      "Comfortable clothes you can move in",
      "A water bottle (we have a tap)",
      "Nothing else: mats, blocks and blankets are here"
    ],
    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "I'm not flexible. Can I still come?",
        "a": "Yes. Flexibility comes from practice, not before it. Every pose is offered at more than one level."
      },
      {
        "q": "How early should I arrive?",
        "a": "Ten minutes before your first class, so we can say hello and ask about any injuries."
      },
      {
        "q": "What if I need to cancel?",
        "a": "Cancel up to six hours before and the class goes back on your pass. Later than that, it counts."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is there somewhere to change?",
        "a": "Two changing rooms, a shower and lockers. Bring a padlock or borrow one at the desk."
      }
